## Arrays and collections

```java-norun
int[] a = new int[5];  int[] b = {1, 2, 3};  Arrays.sort(a);  Arrays.toString(b);
List<String> list = new ArrayList<>(List.of("a", "b"));  list.add("c");  list.get(0);  list.remove("a");
Set<Integer> set = new HashSet<>();  set.add(1);  set.contains(1);
