```

| Need | Use |
|---|---|
| Ordered by index | `ArrayList` |
| Unique, fast lookup | `HashSet` / `HashMap` |
| Sorted | `TreeSet` / `TreeMap` |
| Insertion order | `LinkedHashSet` / `LinkedHashMap` |

## Classes and types

```java-norun
class Account {
    private long balance;                         // encapsulated field
    private static int count;                     // shared by all instances
    Account(long opening) { this.balance = opening; count++; }
    long getBalance() { return balance; }
    @Override public String toString() { return "Account " + balance; }
}
class Savings extends Account { Savings() { super(0); } }
abstract class Shape { abstract double area(); }
interface Notifier { void send(String m); default void hello() { send("hi"); } }
record Point(int x, int y) { Point { if (x < 0) throw new IllegalArgumentException(); } }
enum Level { LOW, HIGH }
sealed interface Expr permits Num, Add { }
```

